Package: lumen
Title: Integrated Clinical Trial Analysis App Built on 'teal'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tulio", "Author", email = "tulio@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Combines the exploratory, safety and efficacy 'teal.gallery'
    templates into a single 'teal' application for clinical trial data in
    CDISC ADaM format. A cached data pipeline (ingestion, pre-processing,
    caching) reads the synthetic datasets bundled with 'random.cdisc.data',
    freshly generated synthetic data with configurable size and seed, or ADaM
    parquet files. Every data source is checked against a data contract, and
    each analysis starts with the population of its source template (safety
    or intent-to-treat).
